  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eurasia NGO support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Eurasia civila samh&#xE4;llet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ger st&#xF6;d till den georgiska organisationen Eurasia Partnership Foundation. Syftet med st&#xF6;det &#xE4;r att st&#xE4;rka det civila samh&#xE4;llet i Georgien. Inom verksamheten ing&#xE5;r att bist&#xE5; bidragss&#xF6;kande i utformning av projekt och genomf&#xF6;randeplaner och operativa program d&#xE4;r EPF fungerar som en sammankallande akt&#xF6;r bland intressenterna i en viss fr&#xE5;ga.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is providing core support to Eurasia Partnership Foundation which is locally led. The aim of the support is to strengthen the civil society in Georgia.Among the activities are grants programmes, assisting grant applicants on project design and implementation schedules and operating programmes where EPF acts as a convener among stakeholders on a particular issue.</narrative>
  </description>
